msgid "build.frost.charged_wave.description"
msgstr "Release RMB to fire. Hold {threshold_sec}s for a full-size frost crescent dealing {damage_percent}% normal damage with {cooldown_ratio}x cooldown; release earlier for a normal wave. Frost visuals alone do not grant freeze."

