msgstr "Requires RMB freeze capability, such as ice attunement. Successfully opening a freeze or boss frost slow window with RMB grants {shield_amount} shield for {duration_sec}s, with a {trigger_cooldown_sec}s trigger cooldown. Chill buildup and resisted freeze attempts do not grant protection."

